Tu Hi Yaar Mera Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Pati Patni Aur Woh sang by Arijit Singh and Neha Kakkar.

Strumming Pattern: DDD UDUD

[G]Akhiyan meri poochh rahi hain,        [Em]Dum ko mere chain nahi hai
[C]Kithe ladaiyan ve,        [D]Tu akhiyan kithe ladaiyan ve

[G]Kaise tujhko main bataun,        [Em]Raahein teri takkti jaaun
[C]Neenda churaiyan ve,        [D]Tu mewriyan neendan churaiyan ve

[G]Dhadkan yeh kehti hai,        [C]Dil tere bin dhadke na
[G]Ik tu hi yaar mera,        [D]Mujhko kya duniya se lena

